<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<usx version="3.0">
  <book code="ECC" style="id">ECC- Ngulu Bible Version</book>
  <para style="h">Mbilikizi</para>
  <para style="toc1">Mbilikizi</para>
  <para style="toc2">Mbilikizi</para>
  <para style="mt2">Mbi</para>
  <para style="mt1">Mbilikizi</para>
  <para style="imt">ULONGOELO</para>
  <para style="ip">Kitabu iki cha Mbilikizi chahiniza mzungu mwo wikazi. Icho kikulongwa mwe kitabu iki enga ivo kitapitwe kulawa mwo ulosi wa Kiibulania, nuko kugamba, “Mnt'hu akuduganya want'hu.” Wamanyi wengi wahuwila kugamba seuta Selemani niye mwandisi ywe kitabu iki, mna wamwenga hawakuhuwila ivo. Selemani ekalaga kwe miyaka ya 970-931 umwo Kilisito andaga akei kwelekwa, naho niyo miyaka ikitabu iki chawandikagwa. Mna wamanyi watuhu wahuwila kugamba kitabu iki chawandikagwa ni mtuhu kwaviya mwo lupisi ulo ulosi noukalongeswa ni ulosi wa wandima kujink'ha wa seuta. Mbilikizi 5:8-9. Wamanyi awo wafanyanya kugamba kitabu cho Mbilikizi vadahika hachasunguzaga kuwandikwa, vadahaika ni hagati yo mwaka 400 na 200 aho Kilisito andaga hanati kwelekwa. Mbilikizi akonga na ulosi akagamba, kila kint'hu ni enga mp'heho ikusunguza kwaganika 1:2. Nuko kugamba wikazi wetu ne zindima zetu ni za lupisi du naho ni vidala kuhuwila. Aya yose nayajaligwe kwa lupisi lugihi. Yose aya hayamuli mwo udahi wetu. Ivo ni vedi kuuzumila wikazi enga ivo wili na kuzungula kinyemi kwa kiya kinanacho 9:9. wa kubindiliza kitabu iki, Iki ni kint'hu hekikuungwa kusweswa, fanyanyi mwa madala yose na kinyemi mwo wikazi ni kumwogoha Mnungu na kudamanya yadya akukigamba kidamanye 12:13.</para>
  <para style="io">Ayo yemndani:</para>
  <para style="io">Kitabu cho mbilikizi, chamtambula mwandisi ywe kitabu hamwenga no wikazi wakwe. Msafa 1 kuita 11 mwo mnango wa nk'hongo.</para>
  <para style="io">Iviya iviya mwe kitabu iki mmbilikizi akanya. Mnango wa 1:12 mpaka 6:9.</para>
  <para style="io">Kwalavigwa ulangilizi wa mhinizi. Mnango 6:10 mpaka 12:8.</para>
  <para style="io">Kwo uheelo, wadadazula ikitabu kwa kugamba ukutaila kwose kwo wikazi ni kumwogoha Mnungu na kudamanya yadya akugamba kidamanye, mnango wa 12 msafa wa 9 mpaka 14.</para>
  <chapter number="1" style="c" sid="ECC 1" />
  <para style="s">Wikazi hewiina kint'hu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ECC 1:1" />Ikutimila ni milosi ya mbilikizi mwana Daudi, uyo Daudi andaga seuta ywa Yelusalemu.<verse eid="ECC 1:1" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="ECC 1:2" />Mbilikizi agamba mwo wikazi uno kila kint'hu hakina waambizi. <verse eid="ECC 1:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ECC 1:3" />Mnt'hu ana upati wani mwe zindima zakwe zose aha he isi? <verse eid="ECC 1:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ECC 1:4" />Cheleko cheza niyo chahalawa niyo cheza kituhu, mna isi yekala iivo mazuwa yose. <verse eid="ECC 1:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ECC 1:5" />Zuwa dyatont'homoka na kuswa, na kusunguza ukuswa. <verse eid="ECC 1:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ECC 1:6" />Mp'heho yavumila kuhinga kwa mkoma mahanya niyo yahitukila kwa mwenyemzi, akajika yauiya kuzunguluka kwakwe ulo na ulo. <verse eid="ECC 1:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ECC 1:7" />Mito yose yaseela kwe bahali, mna ibahali haikumema mbwitu, uko ikulawa imito nuko ikuuya naho. <verse eid="ECC 1:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ECC 1:8" />Vint'hu vose vasokeza, hevikudaha kusimuilwa. Ziso hadikusokela kuona naho gutwi hadikusokela ukwiva. <verse eid="ECC 1:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="ECC 1:9" />Kikunda aaho, nekize kinde aaho naho, ayo yadamanyagwa nayo yakudamanywa, mwe isi hakihali kint'hu kihya. <verse eid="ECC 1:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ECC 1:10" />Want'hu wagamba, “Kaula mbuli mp'hya.” Bule, aya yalailaga uko kale umwo suwe chandaga kikei kwelekwa. <verse eid="ECC 1:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ECC 1:11" />Want'hu wa kale nawande wajaligwa, hata awo wakwiza hawakumbukilwe ni awo nawakitimile.<verse eid="ECC 1:11" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ayo aone mbilikizi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="ECC 1:12" />Miye mbilikizi nehinda seuta ywa Izilaeli uko Yelusalemu, <verse eid="ECC 1:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="ECC 1:13" />nehikaulisa na kupelemba kwa wengele kila kint'hu kilaile mwe isi.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="ECC 1:13">Mnungu nae kawenk'ha want'hu makunt'ho makulu. <verse eid="ECC 1:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ECC 1:14" />Hiyaona yose yakudamanywa mwe isi, kugamba hi kint'hu, ni enga kugulusa mp'heho. <verse eid="ECC 1:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ECC 1:15" />Kigonjile hakikudaha kuchululwa, na kint'hu hekihali hakikudaha kuwazwa.<verse eid="ECC 1:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="ECC 1:16" />Ivo, nafanyanyaga mwenye, “Hikepatila mzungu utendese kujink'ha wose wanilongoelaga kulongoza Yelusalemu. Ivo ubala no umanyi hivimanya vedi.” <verse eid="ECC 1:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="ECC 1:17" />Naho nakombekaga kumanya kuzagula umanyi, uhezi na ukilalu, mna nabunk'hulaga kugamba ayo yose ni enga kugulusa mp'heho. <verse eid="ECC 1:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="ECC 1:18" />Kwaviya mwo umanyi utendese mna kiyangayanga, naho akongezela ubala naande na sungusungu vitendese.<verse eid="ECC 1:18" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ECC 1" />
  <chapter number="2" style="c" sid="ECC 2" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ECC 2:1" />Ivo nafanyanyaga mwo moyo wangu hakegamba, nigeze kwa vint'hu va kukebwedeza. Mna hata mwe idyo nadyo nabunk'hulaga kugamba, kudamanya ivo hiyo kint'hu. <verse eid="ECC 2:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ECC 2:2" />Mwo luseko nalo naonaga kugamba ni uhezi, Togola mwe kinyemi namo mna kibwai chani? <verse eid="ECC 2:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ECC 2:3" />Nagezaga kukeink'ha kinyemi kwa kunywa mp'hombe na kudamanya mbuli za kihezi, mna uku ubala wangu ukalongozwa ni mzungu. Nehazungula kugamba ni kihi chedi want'hu wakuungwa wadamanye mwa mazua aya mageke wakwikala mwe isi ino.<verse eid="ECC 2:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="ECC 2:4" />Nakongaga kudamanya ndima nk'hulu. Nakezengelaga mazumba makulu na kulima nk'honde za mizabibu. <verse eid="ECC 2:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ECC 2:5" />Nakedamanyilaga kiunga cha mabwali na kuhanda maziti ya matunda yehengi. <verse eid="ECC 2:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ECC 2:6" />Nasimbaga makawa ya mazi yo kuyomeela ayo maziti. <verse eid="ECC 2:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ECC 2:7" />Nagulaga watumwa wa kigosi na wa kivele watuhu nawo welekagwa mwe nyumba yangu. Nandaga na ugoli ubindile wingi mafyo ya ng'ombe na ngoto kujink'ha mnt'hu yeyose ekalaga Yelusalemu. <verse eid="ECC 2:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ECC 2:8" />Nakeduganyilaga masawa na zahabu kulawa mwe vindolo va maseuta na kulawa mwe ziisi, name napataga wakemi wagosi kwa wavele na wawele wahombwele wanibwedezese.<verse eid="ECC 2:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="ECC 2:9" />Naho nandaga mnt'hu mkulu kujink'ha yeyose mwe Yelusalemu, naho nandilisaga na mzungu. <verse eid="ECC 2:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ECC 2:10" />Kila naonaga chedi nakipataga, moyo wangu hiunyimile uwedi wowose, kwaviya moyo wangu wawagilagwa na yadya nidamanye na ino neinda nidyo digeleko dyangu. <verse eid="ECC 2:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ECC 2:11" />Niyo nafanyanya yose nidamanye, ivo nakombekaga kudamanya ndima, niyo nabunk'hula kugamba yadya yose nidamanye hi kint'hu, neinda ni enga kugulusa mp'heho, hakwandaga na upati wowose mwe isi. <verse eid="ECC 2:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="ECC 2:12" />Ivo nafanyanyaga kunda na umanyi na kunda mhezi na kubwalata.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="ECC 2:12">Nakeuzaga seuta akwiza naadahe kudamanya kint'hu chani. <verse eid="ECC 2:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="ECC 2:13" />Ivo miye nabunk'hulaga kugamba umanyi ni wedi kujink'ha uhezi, enga ivo ungazi wili wedi kujink'ha ziza. <verse eid="ECC 2:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ECC 2:14" />Mta umanyi kamanya uko akuita mna mhezi hakumanya icho akudamanya. Hata ivo himanya kugamba mta umanyi na mhezi uheelo wawe ni umwenga. <verse eid="ECC 2:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ECC 2:15" />Ivo nalongaga mwo moyo wangu. “Ayo nayampate mhezi nayanipate miye. Nii handa na mzungu uno wose? Nalongaga mwo moyo wangu hagamba yose aya hi kint'hu.” <verse eid="ECC 2:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="ECC 2:16" />Ivo elo kwa mnt'hu mta umanyi, enga ivo vikunda kwa mhezi, naajaligwe kwa lupisi luguhi, kwe mazua yakwiza wose nawajaligwe. Enga ivo vili kwa mhezi hata mta mizungu nawabanike. <verse eid="ECC 2:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="ECC 2:17" />Ivo nawiihiyaga wikazi wose mwe isi. Wikazi wose nounda hi kint'hu naho ni enga kugulusa mp'heho.<verse eid="ECC 2:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="ECC 2:18" />Ivo nayaihiyaga yose nidamanye mwe isi, kwaviya naungwa nimwasile yudya akwiza kunyuma yangu hant'hu ha miye. <verse eid="ECC 2:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="ECC 2:19" />Naho niani akuunga ande mmanyi hegu mhezi? Hata ivo yose nidamanye nayande yakwe aha he isi. Ino yose hi kint'hu. <verse eid="ECC 2:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ECC 2:20" />Ivo, nafanyanyaga naho mwa yose nidamanye he isi, nafaga chevu. <verse eid="ECC 2:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="ECC 2:21" />Kwaviya mnt'hu adaha kudamanya ndima kwa umanyi na ubala na mizungu yakwe, akajika amlekela mnt'hu mtuhu heevidamanyile ndima aonele kinyemi mwo upati we ndima yakwe. Ayo yose iviyaiviya hi kint'hu. <verse eid="ECC 2:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="ECC 2:22" />Mnt'hu apata upati wani kwa ndima zakwe zose na kukombeka kwakwe aha he isi? <verse eid="ECC 2:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="ECC 2:23" />Kwaviya wikazi wakwe wose nounda wa makunt'ho, ndima zakwe zose nazo zandaga na makunt'ho du hata nekilo ubala wakwe haukuhumula. Ayo yose hi kint'hu.<verse eid="ECC 2:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="ECC 2:24" />Hakihali kint'hu chedi akudaha kudamanya mnt'hu kujink'ha ukudya no kunywa na kwelelwa ne ndima yakwe.Kumbe idi nadyo dyalawa kwa Mnungu, <verse eid="ECC 2:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="ECC 2:25" />kwaviya uneva hi yehe niani akudaha kudy na kunda na kinyemi? <verse eid="ECC 2:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="ECC 2:26" />Kwa mnt'hu akumwelela Mnungu, uyo Mnungu amwink'ha umanyi, ubala, na kinyemi. Mna mta wavu Mnungu amwink'ha kuduganya na kuwiika ugoli akajika amwink'ha mnt'hu amwelele.. Ayo yose ni enga kugulusa mp'heho.<verse eid="ECC 2:26" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ECC 2" />
  <chapter number="3" style="c" sid="ECC 3" />
  <para style="s">Kila kint'hu kina lupisi lwakwe</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ECC 3:1" />Kila mbuli yalaila kwa lupisi lwakwe aha he isi.<verse eid="ECC 3:1" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="ECC 3:2" />Lupisi lwa kwelekwa na lupisi lwa kubanika.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ECC 3:2">Lupisi lwa kuhanda na lupisi lwa uvuni .<verse eid="ECC 3:2" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="ECC 3:3" />Lupisi lwa kukoma na lupisi lwa kuhonya.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ECC 3:3">Lupisi lwa kuzenga na lupisi lwa kumola.<verse eid="ECC 3:3" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="ECC 3:4" />lupisi lwa kuila na lupisi lwa kuseka.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ECC 3:4">Lupisi lwa kuhongeza na lupisi lwa kwanga.<verse eid="ECC 3:4" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="ECC 3:5" />Lupisi lwa kuduula maiwe na lupisi lwa kuyaduganya hamwenga kwa kuyadamanyila ndima.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ECC 3:5">Lupisi lwa kuwaduganya want'hu na lupisi lwa kuleka kuwaduganya.<verse eid="ECC 3:5" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="ECC 3:6" />Lupisi lwa kuzungula na lupisi lwa kwaza.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ECC 3:6">Lupisi lwa kuika na lupisi lwa kuduula.<verse eid="ECC 3:6" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="ECC 3:7" />Lupisi lwa kutatula na lupisi lwa kusuma.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ECC 3:7">Lupisi lwa kunyamala na lupisi lwa kulonga.<verse eid="ECC 3:7" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="ECC 3:8" />Lupisi lwa kuunga na lupisi lwa kuihiya.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ECC 3:8">Iviyaiviya na lupisi lwa nk'hondo na lupisi lwa utondowazi.<verse eid="ECC 3:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="ECC 3:9" />Mchuuzi apata upati wani mwe zindima zakwe zose? <verse eid="ECC 3:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ECC 3:10" />Miye hiona ndima ndala izo want'hu wenk'higwe ni Mnungu. <verse eid="ECC 3:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ECC 3:11" />Mnungu katenda kila kint'hukilaile kwa lupisi lwakwe. Naho hakuli yeyose akudaha kukombaganya yose ayo adamanye, naho kakitenda kise kukombaganya mbuli zomboke na izo zikulongole. <verse eid="ECC 3:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="ECC 3:12" />Namanya kugamba, kwa mnt'hu iyuko mbuli imwenga du yo kumuwagila, ni kunda na kinyemi mwo lupisi lwose lwo ugima wakwe.<verse eid="ECC 3:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="ECC 3:13" />Suwe chose chaungwa kudya na kunywa na kunda na kinyemi mwa yadya kipatile mwe zindima zetu. Ayo ni uwagilwa kwa Mnungu.<verse eid="ECC 3:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="ECC 3:14" />Naho himanya kugamba dyodyose akudamanya Mnungu dyekala ulo na ulo. Hakihali kikudaha kugenyeza hegu kuhungula, Mnungu kadamanya ivo vileke want'hu kimwogohe na kummvika yehe. <verse eid="ECC 3:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ECC 3:15" />Chochose kikulaila ivi haluse, chandaga aho kale, kikwiza kulongole chajikaga kale, Mnungu naye ayatendaga yadya yomboke yakeuiye naho.<verse eid="ECC 3:15" /></para>
  <para style="s">Kuuswesa uwagilwa mwe isi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="ECC 3:16" />Iviyaiviya hiona kugamba, housengelo uwihi nao wiyaho, naho hant'hu ho uwagilwa ukwank'walu nawo wiyaho. <verse eid="ECC 3:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="ECC 3:17" />Ivo nafanyanyaga mwo moyo wangu, Mnungu naawasengela wata wavu na heweena wavu, kwaviya kaika lupisi kwa kila mbuli. <verse eid="ECC 3:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="ECC 3:18" />Naho iviyaiviya nalongaga mwo moyo wangu kugamba, Mnungu awageza want'hu vileke awalagise du ivo weli. Woho ni enga makala matuhu. <verse eid="ECC 3:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="ECC 3:19" />Kwaviya dikuwalaila want'hu nidyo dikulaila kwe viumbwa vituhu. Wose wahema iviyaiviya, mnt'hu hi ywedi kujink'ha makala, ayo yose hikint'hu. <verse eid="ECC 3:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ECC 3:20" />Wose wawagilwa na kuita hamwenga, wose walawa mwe sanga naho wose nawauye mwe sanga. <verse eid="ECC 3:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="ECC 3:21" />Niani amanyize kugamba muye wa mnt'hu waita kulanga mna muye wa makala waita hasi? <verse eid="ECC 3:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="ECC 3:22" />Naho nabunk'hulaga kugamba hakihali kint'hu chedi kimwenga kwa mnt'hu kudamanya kujink'ha kuzionela kinyemi zindima zakwe nivo vikuleka kiaha. Hahali yeyose naakivuze kulawa mwo kubanika vileke kize kionele kinyemi wikazi wetu.<verse eid="ECC 3:22" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ECC 3" />
  <chapter number="4" style="c" sid="ECC 4" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ECC 4:1" />Niyo naona masulumizo yose yakulaila mwe isi. Want'hu wakusulumizwa waila, mna hehali yeyose akuwasangalaza. Wasulumizi wana udahi mkulu, nivo vikuleka hakuna wa kuwasangalaza. <verse eid="ECC 4:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ECC 4:2" />Ivo nafanyanyaga kugamba, want'hu wabanike wana kinyemi kujink'ha wagima wakwikala mwe isi. <verse eid="ECC 4:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ECC 4:3" />Mna ana uwedi kujink'ha awo waidi ni yudya henati kwelekwa, hanati kuona maihi yose yakudamanywa aha he isi.<verse eid="ECC 4:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="ECC 4:4" />Naho nabunk'hulaga kugamba ndima zose na umanyi wakwe mwe zindima valawa mwo kuhigana, ayo yose hi kint'hu, ni enga kugulusa mp'heho. <verse eid="ECC 4:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ECC 4:5" />Mhezi hakudamanya ndima naho uheelo wakwe akekoma na sala. <verse eid="ECC 4:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ECC 4:6" />Ni vedi kunda na kidodo hamwenga na utondowazi mwo moyo, kujink'ha kunda na kikulu hamwenga na makunt'ho, ni enga kugulusa mp'heho.<verse eid="ECC 4:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="ECC 4:7" />Naho naonaga mbuli hi kint'hu vitendese mwe isi. <verse eid="ECC 4:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ECC 4:8" />Namuwonaga mnt'hu yumwenga heena mwana hegu ndugu. Hamwenga na ayo andaga akadamanyisa ndima augenyeze ugoli wakwe enga ivo aungaga. Mna akajika akeuzaga mwenye, “Ivi namdamanyila ani zindima izi, naho nii nekeink'ha kiyangayanga?” Yose aya kumbe hikint'hu he isi<verse eid="ECC 4:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="ECC 4:9" />Ni vedi kunda na mvele kujink'ha kunda wikedu kwaviya waidi awa nawapate maliho yedi kwajili yo undima wawe. <verse eid="ECC 4:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ECC 4:10" />Uneva mnt'hu yumwenga anagwa miyawe naamwinule, Mna hangi yehe mwenye mnt'hu akunda ekedu niyo agwa, uyo haande na mnt'hu ywa kumwinula. <verse eid="ECC 4:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ECC 4:11" />Naivo waidi wananda hamwenga nawadahe kwambizana, mna ananda ekedu haadahe kukeambiza mwenye? <verse eid="ECC 4:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="ECC 4:12" />Hamwenga na kugamba mnt'hu yumwenga ekedu adaha kuhumwa ni mnk'hondo, mna wananda waidi nawamhume mnk'hondo ywawe. Hiyo vihufu kukant'ha sigi nt'hatu zinabilingwa hamwenga.<verse eid="ECC 4:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="ECC 4:13" />Ni vedi mbwanga mkiwa ana umanyi kujink'ha seuta mdala mhezi, uyo heekutegeleza ulangilizi wedi, <verse eid="ECC 4:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ECC 4:14" />hata uneva andaga mvugailwa mna haluse kanda seuta, naho hegu elekwagwa mkiwa mna haluse kanda seuta. <verse eid="ECC 4:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ECC 4:15" />Nawaonaga want'hu wose wakwikala mwe isi, wamtimilaga yudya mbwanga ahokelaga useuta. <verse eid="ECC 4:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="ECC 4:16" />Uwazilo wa want'hu nounda hauna uheelo, mna yehe awalongozaga wose, hamwenga na awo nawelekwe nyumani hawamuonele kinyemi, kindedi ayo yose hi kint'hu, ni enga kugulusa mp'heho.<verse eid="ECC 4:16" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ECC 4" />
  <chapter number="5" style="c" sid="ECC 5" />
  <para style="s">Kint'hiza kiya ulagane</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ECC 5:1" />Unde na wengele ukaita kwe nyumba ya Mnungu. Ita utegeleze kujink'ha kulava nt'hambiko enga izo wakulava wahezi, awo hewemanyize kugamba ayo wakudamanya yaiha. <verse eid="ECC 5:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ECC 5:2" />Usekulonga milosi ya kihezi, naho moyo wako usekunda na kihufya mwo kulonga ho undiilo wa Mnungu. <verse eid="ECC 5:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ECC 5:3" />Kwangadika kwingi kwagela sozi, nivo zili simulizi za mhezi zikanda na milosi mingi. <verse eid="ECC 5:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ECC 5:4" />Unamwikila Mnungu lagano usunguze kudiusa. Mnungu hakwelelwa ni wahezi, ivo usa lagano udiikile. <verse eid="ECC 5:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ECC 5:5" />Ni vedi unanda huikile lagano kujink'ha kuika niyo hudiusile. <verse eid="ECC 5:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ECC 5:6" />Kaulisa milosi yako inase kukutenda udamanye wavu, vileke umgambe Mnungu hwaungile kudamanya wavu. Nii umtende Mnungu akuihiye na kuibananga ndima yako? <verse eid="ECC 5:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ECC 5:7" />Kwaviya kulota sozi nyingi, naho kudamanya ndima nyingi heziina chochose, kikulu cho kutoza ni kumwogoha Mnungu.<verse eid="ECC 5:7" /></para>
  <para style="s">Wikazi mwe isi hi kint'hu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="ECC 5:8" />Usekwituka kuona mwe isi wakiwa wakahujilwa naho usengelo no uwagilwa wawe ukazaganywa, kila mta nt'hunyo akuwahujila wakiwa ehasi ya mnt'hu mtuhu, naho kulanga ya awo waidi, weyuko wakulu watuhu watendese.<verse eid="ECC 5:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="ECC 5:9" />Upati we isi ni wambizi kwaajili ya wose, hata seuta naye egutila mwe izo zink'honde.<verse eid="ECC 5:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="ECC 5:10" />Mnt'hu akuungisa matundu hakwiguta matundu hegu akumunk'hilwa ni ugoli hata anapata hakwiguta. Idyo nadyo hi kint'hu. <verse eid="ECC 5:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ECC 5:11" />Mgenyezo wa ugoli wegala mgenyezo wa wata kudya, haluse mta ugoli naye ana upati wani, vituhu vakwe akaula ugoli wakwe du? <verse eid="ECC 5:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="ECC 5:12" />Nt'hongo za mlimi ni zedi akanda kadya ludodo hegu kadilisa, mna mta ugoli ubindile wingi haukumwink'ha nt'hongo mgoli.<verse eid="ECC 5:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="ECC 5:13" />Naho hiona mbuli imwenga du yo uwihi mwe isi, mnt'hu akeduganyilaga ugoli mna haukumwambiza chochose mwe makunt'ho, <verse eid="ECC 5:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ECC 5:14" />naho ugoli uwo wamchupulukaga niyo waga, naye akanda keleka mwana, hakihali chochose kisigale kwajili ya mwana. <verse eid="ECC 5:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ECC 5:15" />Mnt'hu elekwa kimbwigili mwe zinda za nine, naho naahalawe enga ivo ezile. Haahalawe na chochose mwe ivo azungule. <verse eid="ECC 5:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="ECC 5:16" />Ino nayo ni mbuli iihise, naauye enga ivo ezile, kwaviya kwangadika kwake ni enga kugulusa mp'heho. <verse eid="ECC 5:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="ECC 5:17" />Mna ekalaga wikazi wakwe wose kwa kinyulu na masulumizo, kwa makunt'ho na manyonge na sungusungu.<verse eid="ECC 5:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="ECC 5:18" />Aya nayo nabunk'hulaga. Ichedi mwa want'hu ni kudya na kunywa na kunda na kinyemi mwe zindima zakwe za mwe isi, mwa mazuwa ayo mageke enk'higwe ni Zumbe Mnungu, kwaviya ivo nivo awaikile. <verse eid="ECC 5:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="ECC 5:19" />Yakujink'ha ayo, umwo Mnungu akamwink'ha mnt'hu ugoli na ukulu, amtenda avionele kinyemi vint'hu ivo, kuzumila icho enk'higwe na kuionela kinyemi ndima yakwe ndala, kwaviya ino nt'hunyo ni kulawa kwa Mnungu. <verse eid="ECC 5:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ECC 5:20" />Ni kwa nk'hanana ngeke mnt'hu akafanyanya mazuwa yo wikazi wakwe, kwaviya Mnungu amtenda mnt'hu uyo ande na kinyemi mwo moyo wakwe.<verse eid="ECC 5:20" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ECC 5" />
  <chapter number="6" style="c" sid="ECC 6" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ECC 6:1" />Hiona mbuli imwenga ihise aha he isi, ikuwasulumiza want'hu. <verse eid="ECC 6:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ECC 6:2" />Mnungu amwink'ha mnt'hu ugoli na nt'hunyo na vint'hu vingi vileke anase kuhungukilwa na chochose akuunga, mna hakumwink'ha luneka aonele kinyemi vint'hu ivo, abanika niyo mnt'hu mtuhu na watakwiza wanda nawo nawayaonele kinyemi ayo. Naho iyo nayo hikint'hu naho ni makunt'ho yatendese. <verse eid="ECC 6:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ECC 6:3" />Mnt'hu anadaha kweleka wana gana, naho niyo ekalisa mwo wikazi wakwe. Mna uneva mnt'hu uyo hana kinyemi mwo wikazi wakwe hegu uneva anabanika na kuswesa kumoselwa msanga haheina nt'hunyo, nagamba ni vedi kwa mwana elekwe na kubanika, <verse eid="ECC 6:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ECC 6:4" />kwaviya kwelekwa kwakwe mwana uyo hikint'hu, zina dyakwe heditambulwe naho. <verse eid="ECC 6:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ECC 6:5" />Hamwenga na kugamba haaone ung'azi we dizua hegu kumanya kint'hu chochose. Uyo mwana ana humuilo kujink'ha mnt'hu uyo. <verse eid="ECC 6:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ECC 6:6" />Uneva mnt'hu uyo neekale myaka alufu mbili naho hana kinyemi mwo wikazi wakwe ni enga uyo mwana, wose waita hant'hu hamwenga.<verse eid="ECC 6:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="ECC 6:7" />Want'hu wadamanyisa ndima vileke wapate nk'hande, mna kumunk'hwamunk'wa kwawe hakukuwegusa. <verse eid="ECC 6:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ECC 6:8" />Togola mta umanyi apatai kujink'ha mhezi? Hegu mkiwa ana kibwai kujink'ha mnt'hu ho undiilo wa want'hu watuhu? <verse eid="ECC 6:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="ECC 6:9" />Ni vedi kuona, kujink'ha kwangadika kwa kumunk'wamunk'ha. Yose ayo hi kint'hu, ni enga kugulusa mp'heho.<verse eid="ECC 6:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="ECC 6:10" />Kila kint'hu kilaile chalailaga aho kale, ivo mnt'hu eli vamanyika, kwaviya msokezi hakudaha kuhigana na mnt'hu mta ludole. <verse eid="ECC 6:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ECC 6:11" />Mbuli zinanda nyingi zanda hi kint'hu, togola izo zamwambiza vivihi mnt'hu? <verse eid="ECC 6:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="ECC 6:12" />Niani akumanya yakumwambiza mnt'hu mwo wikazi wakwe mgihi, wikazi uwo ukomboka enga kizuli? Niani akumanya mwe isi ya kumpata mnt'hu anabanika?<verse eid="ECC 6:12" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ECC 6" />
  <chapter number="7" style="c" sid="ECC 7" />
  <para style="s">Fanyanyi zikwambiza mwo wikazi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ECC 7:1" />Ni vedi mnt'hu ananda na uwedi kujink'ha mavuta ya mhemp'he ya yombe kulu, na zuwa dya kubanika ni dyedi kujink'ha zuwa dyo kwelekwa. <verse eid="ECC 7:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ECC 7:2" />Ni vedi kuita kumoselwa msanga kujink'ha kuita kwe fugo, kwaviya wagima waungwa kukumbukila kugamba file yakigoja suwe chose.<verse eid="ECC 7:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="ECC 7:3" />Kinyulu ni chedi kujink'ha seko, moyo una kinyulu wakiink'ha kufanyanya.<verse eid="ECC 7:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="ECC 7:4" />Moyo wa mta umanyib wafanyanya kumosa msanga mna moyo wa mhezi wafanyanya kuunga ayedi.<verse eid="ECC 7:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="ECC 7:5" />Ni vedi kwiva makanyo ya mta umanyi kujink'ha kwiva mila ya wahezi.<verse eid="ECC 7:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="ECC 7:6" />Kwaviya seko za mhezi ni enga izwi dya miwa mwo moto, aya nayo hi kint'hu.<verse eid="ECC 7:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="ECC 7:7" />Mta umanyi anamhujila mnt'hu, aketenda enga mhezi naho matundu ya soni yabananga umoyo.<verse eid="ECC 7:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="ECC 7:8" />Ni vedi hombindilizo we mbuli kujink'ha nk'hongelo ye mbuli yakwe,</para>
  <para style="p" vid="ECC 7:8">Akufinyiliza mwo moyo ni vedi kujink'ha mnt'hu mta weduvi.<verse eid="ECC 7:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="ECC 7:9" />Usekunda mhufu wa maya, kwaviya maya yekala mndani mwa wahezi.<verse eid="ECC 7:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="ECC 7:10" />Usekuuza, “Ni lupisi lwani lwandaga lwedi kujink'ha lwa ivi haluse?” Kwaviya hiyo vedi kuuza enga ivo.<verse eid="ECC 7:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="ECC 7:11" />Mzungu ni wedi enga ivo wili ukipe, naho ni wedi kwa wagima wose. <verse eid="ECC 7:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="ECC 7:12" />Mzungu ni wamizi enga ivo yeli matundu. Uwedi wo mzungu ni kugamba wamila wikazi wa uyo ananao.<verse eid="ECC 7:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="ECC 7:13" />Fanyanyeni vedi ndima ya Mnungu, niani akudaha kusalahaza ndima ya Mnungu? <verse eid="ECC 7:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ECC 7:14" />Mwe mazuwa yako yo upati unde na kinyemi na mwa mazuwa ya makunt'ho ufanyanye mbuli ino, upati na makunt'ho, Mnungu kayaika aya mazua maidi yagende hamwenga vileke want'hu wase kubunk'hula yakuunga yalaile kulongole.<verse eid="ECC 7:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="ECC 7:15" />Mwo wikazi wangu howiina kint'hu hiyona vint'hu viidi, muwagilwa akabanika akanda mwo uwagilwa wakwe. Mna naho hiona mnt'hu mwavu akagendeela kwikalisa hamwenga na kugamba yehe mwavu. <verse eid="ECC 7:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="ECC 7:16" />Ivo usekundilisa ywedi hegu mta umanyi utendese, nii ukekome weye mwenye? <verse eid="ECC 7:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="ECC 7:17" />Mna usekunda mwavu hegu mhezi, nii ubanike ukanda wikazi wako haunati? <verse eid="ECC 7:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="ECC 7:18" />Ni vedi utoze dya nk'hongo naho usekudileka dya kaidi kwaviya akumzumila Mnungu naande hale na ayo.<verse eid="ECC 7:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="ECC 7:19" />Mzungu wamtenda mta uwedi kunda na ludole kujink'ha vilongozi mlongo wo mzi.<verse eid="ECC 7:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="ECC 7:20" />Hehali mnt'hu ywedi mwe isi akudamanya yedi du haheina kudamanya wavu.<verse eid="ECC 7:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="ECC 7:21" />Naho usekufanyanya mbuli zose zikulongwa na want'hu, sema uneva mtumwa ywako kugamba kakuhomola. <verse eid="ECC 7:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="ECC 7:22" />Kwaviya weye mwenye kumanya mwo moyo wako kugamba kuwaligita nk'hanana nyingi<verse eid="ECC 7:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="ECC 7:23" />Hiyageza ayo yose kwa umanyi hagamba, naunga ninde na mzungu, mna ino hyandile na ludole nayo. <verse eid="ECC 7:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="ECC 7:24" />Mzungu ni kint'hu kidala naho hiyo vihufu kukikombaganya. <verse eid="ECC 7:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="ECC 7:25" />Nahitulaga zifanyanyi zangu vileke nikombaganye, na kupelemba na kuuzungula mzungu na kiya kikuungwa mwe zimbuli, na kukombaganya kugamba wiihi ni uhezi, ukilalu ni ubwalasi.<verse eid="ECC 7:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="ECC 7:26" />Hibunk'hula mbuli imwenga ikulumisa kujink'ha file. Mvele ekale enga mtego, lukunde akukulagisa ni enga lugole lwa kukutegela, mikono yakwe nayo ni enga mnyololo. Mna akumwelela Mnungu amnyilika mvele uyo, mna mta wavu naagwilwe ni uyo mvele. <verse eid="ECC 7:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="ECC 7:27" />Mbilikizi agamba ayo nibunk'hule umwo hapelemba, hibungula kint'hu kimwenga na kituhu naho, umwo nandile mwa idyo nahaunga. <verse eid="ECC 7:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="ECC 7:28" />Nikei napelemba mna hikubunk'hula. Mwa wagosi alufu hiona mgosi yumwenga du muwagilwa mna mwa wavele alufu hiyone yeyose. <verse eid="ECC 7:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="ECC 7:29" />Kaula, hibunk'hula mbuli imwenga du kugamba Mnungu awaumbaga want'hu wedi, mna woho wenye wakezunguilaga makunt'ho.<verse eid="ECC 7:29" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ECC 7" />
  <chapter number="8" style="c" sid="ECC 8" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ECC 8:1" />Niani eli enga mta mzungu? Naho niani akumanya chotoko che vint'hu? Mzungu wamwigaila mnt'hu kinyemi, naho wahitula fanyanyi zo mnt'hu kulawa mwe kinyulu.<verse eid="ECC 8:1" /></para>
  <para style="s">Mzumile seuta</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="ECC 8:2" />Miye nagamba mzumile ayo akulonga seuta, kwaviya yehe kaika lagano kwa Mnungu. <verse eid="ECC 8:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ECC 8:3" />Usekusunguza kuhalawa hakwe, hegu usekugendeela kudamanya yaihile, kwaviya seuta adamanya yakumwelela. <verse eid="ECC 8:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ECC 8:4" />Sigilizi ya seuta ni ulosi wa uheelo, niani akudaha kumuuza mwa icho adamanye. <verse eid="ECC 8:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ECC 8:5" />Akuzumila sigilizi haapate makunt'ho na mta mzungu naamanye lupisi luzumilwe na mitendele. <verse eid="ECC 8:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ECC 8:6" />Kwaviya lwiyuko lupisi luzumilwe na mitendele ya kila mbuli, ikanda want'hu wapata makunt'ho. <verse eid="ECC 8:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ECC 8:7" />Kwaviya hahali yeyose amanyize yakuunga yalaile mazua yakwiza, ivo niani akudaha kumgambila yakwiza? <verse eid="ECC 8:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ECC 8:8" />Hehali mnt'hu yeyose akudaha kuutoza umuye wakwe asekubanika, naho hehali mta udahi mwe dizuwa dyo kubanika. Mwo lupisi lwa nk'hondo hehali akudaha kuuya kunyuma mwe nk'hondo, viligane na iivo wakutenda hawande na ulekelwa.<verse eid="ECC 8:8" /></para>
  <para style="s">Waihi na want'hu wedi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="ECC 8:9" />Aya yose hiyaona mwo upelembi wangu aha he isi, want'hu wamwenga wanda na udahi mwa watuhu, na kuwatenda wasulumile. <verse eid="ECC 8:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ECC 8:10" />Niho nawaonaga want'hu wavu, wakamoswa msanga, wadya wazoelaga kwingila na kufosa hant'hu ha kuvikila na kwink'higwa nt'hogola mwo mzi uwo wandile wadamanya aya. Ayo nayo hi kint'hu.<verse eid="ECC 8:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="ECC 8:11" />Kwaviya want'hu wavu hawakusunguza kusengelwa, ivo mioyo ya want'hu yamema fanyanyi za kudamanya wavu. <verse eid="ECC 8:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="ECC 8:12" />Hamwenga na kugamba wata wavu wadamanya maihi gana niyo wagendeela kwikalisa mwe isi, mna miye namanya kugamba nevindilise ni vedi kwa want'hu wakumvika Mnungu awo wakumwogoha. <verse eid="ECC 8:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="ECC 8:13" />Mna hakihali kinyemi kwa wata wavu, woho nawomboke enga kizuli, wikazi wawe hounde mtali kwaviya hawakumvika Mnungu. <verse eid="ECC 8:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ECC 8:14" />Kuna mbuli imwenga du niibunk'hule aha he isi, want'hu wedi wenk'higwa yadya wawagilwe want'hu waihi, niyo waihi wenk'higwa yawawagile awedi. Ino nayo nagamba hi kint'hu.<verse eid="ECC 8:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="ECC 8:15" />Ivo miye natigiza kugamba mnt'hu aungwa ande na kinyemi, kwaviya aha he isi hakihali ichedi kujink'ha ukudya, ukunywa na kunda na kinyemi. Akajika kinyemi chakwe agendeela nacho kwe zindima zakwe mazuwa yose yo wikazi wakwe, mazua ayo enk'higwe ni Mnungu.<verse eid="ECC 8:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="ECC 8:16" />Kila aho nagezaga kumanya mzungu na kuona ayo yadamanyike aha he isi nabunk'hulaga kugamba wadaha kwikala meso kilo na msi, <verse eid="ECC 8:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="ECC 8:17" />niyo namanya kugamba ndima zose Mnungu adamanye, want'hu hawakudaha kuzimanya, wata mizungu wadaha kukegamba wamanya mna ikindedi hawamanyize.<verse eid="ECC 8:17" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ECC 8" />
  <chapter number="9" style="c" sid="ECC 9" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ECC 9:1" />Kwaivo nayafanyanyaga mwa ayo yose, niyo naona kugamba Mnungu alongoza wata mzungu na wadya wakudamanya ayedi. Mna ikanda ni lukunde hegu maya mnt'hu hamanyize, kila kint'hu kwawe hi kint'hu. <verse eid="ECC 9:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ECC 9:2" />Kwaviya wose wana uheelo uligane, wakumwogoha Mnungu na wata wavu, awedi na waihile, wakukile na wasavu, wakulava malavo na hewekulava malavo. Uyo eli ywedi kaligana du na mta wavu, naho akukelisa hawasane na heekukelisa. <verse eid="ECC 9:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ECC 9:3" />Ino ni mbuli ihise ikulaila aha he isi, kugamba uheelo uligane wawabwiila wose. Naho lupisi lwose lwo wikazi wawe want'hu awo wanda wamema uwihi na ukilalu wakajika wabanika. <verse eid="ECC 9:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ECC 9:4" />Mnt'hu yeyose ehamwenga na wata ugima ana kawiilo, ni vedi kuli ugima kujink'ha simba ifile. <verse eid="ECC 9:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ECC 9:5" />Kwaviya awagima wamanya kugamba kuna kubanika, mna wabanike hawakumanya chochose, hawana nt'hunyo naho wajaligwa vitendese. <verse eid="ECC 9:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ECC 9:6" />Lukunde lwawe na kwiihiya na kumunk'hwa kwawe vose vahalawaga na woho, naho hawande na dyodyose aha he isi.<verse eid="ECC 9:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="ECC 9:7" />Ita ukadye nk'hande yako kwa kinyemi, naho ukanywe divai yako kwa kusangala kwaviya Mnungu kaizumila ndima yako. <verse eid="ECC 9:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ECC 9:8" />Mazuwa yose vala vedi, naho mtwi wako usekuswesa kuhaka mavuta yedi. <verse eid="ECC 9:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="ECC 9:9" />Uonele kinyemi wikazi wako hamwenga na mkazio umuungise mwo ulu lupisi lwose lwa makunt'ho wink'higwe ni Mnungu, kwaaviya ayo nayo upangilwe mwo wikazi wako mwe ndima yako aha he isi. <verse eid="ECC 9:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ECC 9:10" />Kila icho ukuunga udamanye, damanya kwa moyo wako wose, kwaviya uko kwe isi ya wabanike ukuita hakuna ndima hegu mizungu hegu umanyi.<verse eid="ECC 9:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="ECC 9:11" />Naho hiona kint'hu kituhu aha he isi, kugamba wadahi wakugulukisa hawakunda wahumi mwo uhigani wa nguluko, naho wadahi wa nk'hondo hawakunda wahumi kwe nk'hondo, hegu wata mzungu hiyo wapati we nk'hande, naho wata ubala hawakunda wagoli, naho wata umanyi kukwezwa ulongozi, mna lupisi na luneka lwaweziila wose. <verse eid="ECC 9:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="ECC 9:12" />Vitendese ni kugamba hahali akumanya lupisi kwakwe niini, enga ivo samaki zikugwilwa nu ulwavu mwe bahali, naho enga viya madege yakugwilwa mwo ulimbo, nivo want'hu wakugwilwa ni mavuma haheina kukawiila.<verse eid="ECC 9:12" /></para>
  <para style="s">Fanyanyi mwo Mzungu na uhezi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="ECC 9:13" />Naho aha he isi nehiona mliganyizo wo mzungu, naho uwo nauungisaga. <verse eid="ECC 9:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ECC 9:14" />Handaga na mzi umwenga mdodo wandaga na wakaya wageke. Seuta yumwenga mta udahi, auzungulukaga vileke akump'hukile, <verse eid="ECC 9:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ECC 9:15" />mna mwo mzi uwo kwandaga na mkiwa yumwenga mta mzungu, kwa umanyi wakwe auyokolaga umzi uwo, hakwandaga na mnt'hu yeyose amkumbukilaga yudya mkiwa. <verse eid="ECC 9:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="ECC 9:16" />Niho nagambile, mzungu ni wedi kujink'ha ludole, mna mzungu wa mkiwa wabelwa naho zimbuli zakwe hazikutegelezwa. <verse eid="ECC 9:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="ECC 9:17" />Ni vedi kutegeleza milosi ya mta mzungu ikulongwa mp'halahole, kujink'ha kutegeleza izwi dya kilongozi mw kiyeti cha wahezi. <verse eid="ECC 9:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="ECC 9:18" />Mzungu ni wedi kujink'ha vitoanilo va nk'hondo mna mta wavu yumwenga abananga ayedi yose.<verse eid="ECC 9:18" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ECC 9" />
  <chapter number="10" style="c" sid="ECC 10" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ECC 10:1" />Enga viya sofulo zifile zikuleka mp'hofa ihile mwo mhemp'he wedi, mna uhezi wahitula umanyi na nt'hunyo.<verse eid="ECC 10:1" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="ECC 10:2" />Moyo wa mta mzungu wamlongoza kudamanya ayedi mna moyo wa mhezi wamwazaganya. <verse eid="ECC 10:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ECC 10:3" />Mnt'hu mbwalasi hata akagenda mwe sila aswesa ubala. Naho agenda akelavanya kila mnt'hu kugamba yehe mhezi.<verse eid="ECC 10:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="ECC 10:4" />Uneva kilongozi ywako anakufiila maya, usekunda na kifiki kwaviya moyo wa ujalamu wadaha kuhoza maihi yatendese.<verse eid="ECC 10:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="ECC 10:5" />Kuna vuma nibunk'hule aha he isi, uwihi ukutendigwa ni vilongozi, <verse eid="ECC 10:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ECC 10:6" />kugamba wabwalasi wenk'higwa ulongozi wa kulanga na wata ugoli waguha ulongozi wa hasi. <verse eid="ECC 10:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ECC 10:7" />Hiyona watumwa wakugendeza falasi, mna wakulu wagenda lwa viga du enga watumwa.<verse eid="ECC 10:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="ECC 10:8" />Msimba bome adaha kupolomela mwenye, mmola lukandula alumwa mwenye ni nyoka. <verse eid="ECC 10:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="ECC 10:9" />Akutula maiwe yadaha kumnumiza mwenye, naho akutula nk'huni naye zadaha kumnumiza mwenye. <verse eid="ECC 10:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ECC 10:10" />Ludole lwingi lwaungigwa kwa mnt'hu akutema ne hoya heikutwa, mna unadamanya kwa mzungu noudahe. <verse eid="ECC 10:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ECC 10:11" />Uneva mnt'hu mta umanyi wa kuitenda nyoka isekuluma, mna uneva nyoka iyo inasunguza kuluma mnt'hu, umanyi uwo haukudaha kumlagula uyo alumigwe. <verse eid="ECC 10:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="ECC 10:12" />Milosi ya mta mzungu yamwink'ha nt'hogola, mna mhezi akebanaga kwa milosi yakwe mwenye, <verse eid="ECC 10:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="ECC 10:13" />akakonga kulonga alonga uhezi, akabindiliza kulonga alonga enga mkilalu. <verse eid="ECC 10:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ECC 10:14" />Mhezi alonga haheina kunyamala,</para>
  <para style="p" vid="ECC 10:14">Hakuna yeyose akumanya kikuunga kilaile, naho hehali akudaha kulonga yakuunga yalaile kikanda kibanika.<verse eid="ECC 10:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="ECC 10:15" />Mbwalasi asokezwa na ndima yakwe mwenye, hata asekumanya sila ya kuuiya kaya.<verse eid="ECC 10:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="ECC 10:16" />Weye isi hangi we mwenye seuta ywako andaga mtumwa, isi ina vilongozi wakutenda fugo kukongela mtondo. <verse eid="ECC 10:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="ECC 10:17" />Kuvikilwa weye isi una seuta ywa cheleko kina nt'hunyo, weye una seuta akudya nk'hande kwa lupisi luzumilwe vileke upate ludole kwa mndima za kindedi.<verse eid="ECC 10:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="ECC 10:18" />Kwajili yo usokezi wa mnt'hu, misomo ye nyumba yakwe yenama, kwo usokezi uuwo nyumba yakwe yadoda.<verse eid="ECC 10:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="ECC 10:19" />Fugo ni kwaajili ya kwiguta na divai yasangalaza wikazi, mna matundu yabinda mbuli zose.<verse eid="ECC 10:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="ECC 10:20" />Usekumkumlonga vihile seuta hata uneva ni mwe zifanyanyi, hegu usekumligita mgoli hata ukanda kwe chumba chako, kwaviya madege yadaha kuguha ayo ulongile, na ayo madege yakupuluka yadaha kubwelekeza ayo ulongile.<verse eid="ECC 10:20" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ECC 10" />
  <chapter number="11" style="c" sid="ECC 11" />
  <para style="s">Upati wa kukombeka</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ECC 11:1" />Damanya ndima yeyose idya, yadahika wadaha kupata chochose. <verse eid="ECC 11:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ECC 11:2" />Wapangile vint'hu want'hu mfungate hegu mnane hant'hu ho upati wako, kwaviya humanyize yakuunga yalaile mwe isi.<verse eid="ECC 11:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="ECC 11:3" />Mavunde yana mema mazi fula yanya, mti unagweela kwamkoma mahanya hegu kwa mwenyemzi, aho nougweele naho nougone. <verse eid="ECC 11:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ECC 11:4" />Walimi wakugojela msimo uzoelwe hawahande mbeyu na wakukawiila mavunde yahalawe naho hawavune kint'hu. <verse eid="ECC 11:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ECC 11:5" />Enga ivo hwimanyize sila ya mp'heho kugamba ni ihi, hegu mwana akukula mwe zinda mwa nine, nivo hwimanyize zindima za Mnungu ivo akudamanya vint'hu vose. <verse eid="ECC 11:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ECC 11:6" />Handa mbeyu mtondo na nekisingi handa naho kwaviya humanyize nizihi nezihote za nomtondo hegu za kisingi hegu zose nezinde zedi.<verse eid="ECC 11:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="ECC 11:7" />Ikindedi ung'azi ni wedi, kudiona dizuwa nako kwasangalaza ameso. <verse eid="ECC 11:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ECC 11:8" />Hata uneva mnt'hu anekalisa miaka mingi vivihi, aionele kinyemi yose, mna akumbukile mazuwa ya makunt'ho nayande yabinda ingi. Kila kint'hu kikwiza hi kint'hu.<verse eid="ECC 11:8" /></para>
  <para style="s">Kuwakanya wabwanga</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="ECC 11:9" />Weye mbwanga unde na kinyemi mwo ubwanga wako na moyo wako nao usangale umwo ukei mbwanga, timila uwedi wo moyo wako, mna ukumbukile kugamba Mnungu naakusengele mwa ayo yose.<verse eid="ECC 11:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="ECC 11:10" />Ivo elo hausa kiyangayanga mwo moyo wako, kenege usekupata masulumizo kwaviya ubwanga na ludole hi kint'hu.<verse eid="ECC 11:10" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ECC 11" />
  <chapter number="12" style="c" sid="ECC 12" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ECC 12:1" />Umkumbukile Mnungu ywako mwa mazuwa yo ubwanga wako, umwo ukanda ukei kudalahala niyo wagamba, “Heninde naho na kinyemi mwo wikazi uwo.” <verse eid="ECC 12:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ECC 12:2" />Umkumbukile ukanda ung'azi wako haunati kusila, nt'hondo no mnenge vikei kwingila ziza, mavunde nayo yakei kwigala fula. <verse eid="ECC 12:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ECC 12:3" />Mwe dizuwa diya dya waamizi we kaya wakazingiza na viga vako vitogile navo vikagonja, na meno yako nayande hayakudaha, meso yako nayo yakanda hayakukaula. <verse eid="ECC 12:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ECC 12:4" />Umwo zimboni za magutwi yako zikasita, maizwi ya ndima nayo yakanda yakeagiliza, umwo mkenulwa ni maizwi ya madege, mna naho akajika maizwi ayo yose nayagendeele kukeagiliza. <verse eid="ECC 12:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ECC 12:5" />Mwo lupisi ulo nowogohe kunda hant'hu ha kulanga, kugenda mwe sila nako nokunde kwatisa, na mwo mtwi wakwe nounde umema fii, mna weye nounde huna kint'hu chochose nouungise naho.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="ECC 12:5">Niho mnt'hu naakeitile kwe dihumuilo dyakwe dya mazuwa yose, wakuhongeza nao nawande wakanda wakazunguluka zunguluka mwe sila. <verse eid="ECC 12:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ECC 12:6" />Mkumbukile Muumbi ywako mwo mbwanga wako, kwaviya diyaho zuwa nedibule kwo uheelo nounde enga mkufu wa masawa, naho haunati utulike enga lwiga lwa zahabu, hegu enga biga dikutulika kwe disima, naho enga bika dikutulikila kwe dizumi. <verse eid="ECC 12:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ECC 12:7" />Naho luvumbi noluuye mwe sanga na muye ywako nouuye kwa Mnungu akuumbaga.<verse eid="ECC 12:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="ECC 12:8" />Miye mbilikizi nagamba, vint'hu vose hi kint'hu, naho havina wambizi.<verse eid="ECC 12:8" /></para>
  <para style="s">Milosi yo mbindilizo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="ECC 12:9" />Mna uyo mbilikizi andanga na mzungu ivo agendeelaga kuwahinyiza want'hu umanyi, yehe ahimaga na kufanyanya niyo apelemba kwa wengele niyo atula ngelo zibindile wingi. <verse eid="ECC 12:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ECC 12:10" />Mbilikizi akombekaga kupata mbuli zedi za kwelela na kiya awandike ni chedi naho ni kindedi. <verse eid="ECC 12:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ECC 12:11" />Simo za wata umanyi ni enga mliganyizo wa nk'home isonk'hoke, naho milosi yawe ni enga mitunga igomandilwe mwo mti, nivo zili zimbuli za wakulu mwe midugano kulawa kwa mdimi yumwenga.<verse eid="ECC 12:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="ECC 12:12" />Naho mwanangu ukajink'ha ayo uzumile makanyo hauhali uheelo wowose wo kuwandika vitabu vibindile wingi, naho kusomesa kwasokeza.<verse eid="ECC 12:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="ECC 12:13" />Uwazilo we zimbuli zose ni uno, mbuli zose zivika kale. Mwogohe Mnungu naho uzitimile zisigilizi zakwe kwaviya ayo nayo want'hu wakuungwa kuyatimila. <verse eid="ECC 12:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ECC 12:14" />Kwaviya Mnungu naasengele udamanyi wetu wose, hata yadya yakudamanywa kwa kinyele yande yedi hegu yaihile.<verse eid="ECC 12:14" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ECC 12" />
</usx>